    "storage": {
      "value": "<ac:layout><ac:layout-section ac:type=\"two_right_sidebar\"><ac:layout-cell><h2>Description</h2><p>The Clinical App contains configuration for the Clinical Module.</p><p>The configuration files should be under bahmni_config/openmrs/apps/clinical of your web server. The app configuration needs an app.json, an extension.json, medication.json, dashboard.json, visit.json. Optionally, you could add a formConditions.js and an extension-x.json. Please see the list below for further details about configuring the JSON files.</p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"tip\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"d6a4fb3e-218f-4efd-8a3b-f24022e2a2f9\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">JSON files in the Clinical App</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"children\" ac:schema-version=\"2\" ac:macro-id=\"a4a3ac4d-b692-477e-84a0-6cc090462550\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"all\">true</ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p></ac:layout-cell><ac:layout-cell><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"panel\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"2e090de1-f033-4179-bcca-609200e0a042\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleColor\">White</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleBGColor\">#1FA5A0</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">Related Links</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p><ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Clinical Module\" /><ac:plain-text-link-body><![CDATA[Clinical Module - Implementer's Guide]]></ac:plain-text-link-body></ac:link></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro></ac:layout-cell></ac:layout-section></ac:layout>",
