    "view": {
      "value": "<div class=\"contentLayout2\">\n<div class=\"columnLayout two-right-sidebar\" data-layout=\"two-right-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<h2 id=\"ClinicalApp-Description\">Description</h2><p>The Clinical App contains configuration for the Clinical Module.</p><p>The configuration files should be under bahmni_config/openmrs/apps/clinical of your web server. The app configuration needs an app.json, an extension.json, medication.json, dashboard.json, visit.json. Optionally, you could add a formConditions.js and an extension-x.json. Please see the list below for further details about configuring the JSON files.</p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-tip conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"d6a4fb3e-218f-4efd-8a3b-f24022e2a2f9\" data-macro-name=\"tip\"><p class=\"title\">JSON files in the Clinical App</p><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-approve confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p> </p><ul class=\"childpages-macro conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-macro-id=\"a4a3ac4d-b692-477e-84a0-6cc090462550\" data-macro-name=\"children\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/36700210/medication.json\" data-linked-resource-id=\"36700210\" data-linked-resource-version=\"62\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">medication.json</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/37945559/extension.json\" data-linked-resource-id=\"37945559\" data-linked-resource-version=\"16\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">extension.json</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/37945561/app.json\" data-linked-resource-id=\"37945561\" data-linked-resource-version=\"18\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">app.json</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/37945563/visit.json\" data-linked-resource-id=\"37945563\" data-linked-resource-version=\"11\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">visit.json</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/37945565/formConditions.js\" data-linked-resource-id=\"37945565\" data-linked-resource-version=\"28\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">formConditions.js</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/37945567/extension-programs.json\" data-linked-resource-id=\"37945567\" data-linked-resource-version=\"8\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">extension-programs.json</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/37945569/dashboard.json\" data-linked-resource-id=\"37945569\" data-linked-resource-version=\"34\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">dashboard.json</a></li></ul><p> </p></div></div><p> </p><p> </p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cell aside\" data-type=\"aside\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"2e090de1-f033-4179-bcca-609200e0a042\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;background-color: #1FA5A0;color: White;\"><b>Related Links</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/32014548/Clinical+Module\" data-linked-resource-id=\"32014548\" data-linked-resource-version=\"11\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Clinical Module - Implementer's Guide</a></p>\n</div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
